{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25469","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 鸂鶒 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 鸂鶒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清沚双鸂鶒，前年海上雏。\n今年恋洲屿，思若在江湖。\n欲起摇荷盖，闲飞溅水珠。\n不能常泛泛，惟作逐波凫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}